#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.sample.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.sample"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:1 of
msgid "Return a random sample of rows from the frame."
msgstr "从帧中随机采样行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:3 of
msgid ""
"By default, sampling is performed independently within each chunk, which "
"is faster but approximate. Set ``exact=True`` for globally coordinated "
"sampling that guarantees statistically correct results across the entire "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，采样在每个 chunk 内独立进行，速度更快但为近似值。设置 "
"``exact=True`` 可使用全局协调采样，确保整个帧的统计结果精确。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:8 of
msgid "Number of rows to return. Cannot be used with ``frac``."
msgstr "返回的行数。不能与 ``frac`` 同时使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:10 of
msgid ""
"Fraction of rows to return (``0``–``1`` for ``replace=False``). Cannot be"
" used with ``n``."
msgstr "返回行的比例（``replace=False`` 时取值范围为 ``0``–``1``）。不能与 ``n`` 同时使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:13 of
msgid "Allow sampling the same row more than once."
msgstr "是否允许同一行被多次采样。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:15 of
msgid ""
"Column name (str) for column-based weights, or a single-column LiteFrame "
"aligned with the data."
msgstr "用于基于列权重的列名（str），或与数据对齐的单列 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:18 of
msgid "Seed for reproducibility."
msgstr "用于可复现性的随机种子。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:20 of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, use globally coordinated sampling for exact statistical "
"correctness. If ``False``, each chunk samples independently — faster but "
"approximate."
msgstr ""
"为 ``True`` 时，使用全局协调采样以确保统计精确性。为 ``False`` 时，每个 "
"chunk 独立采样——速度更快但为近似值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:25 of
msgid "Sampled frame."
msgstr "采样后的帧。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:29 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.sample.sample:30 of
msgid ""
"In distributed (multi-chunk) execution with ``exact=False``, sampling is "
"per-chunk. For ``replace=True`` this means rows can only be duplicated "
"within their own chunk. Use ``exact=True`` when global correctness is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"在分布式（多 chunk）执行环境下使用 ``exact=False`` 时，采样按 chunk 进行。"
"对于 ``replace=True``，行只能在其所属 chunk 内被重复采样。如需全局正确性，"
"请使用 ``exact=True``。"
